*** Keywords ***
Wait For The Start Of Extreme Deep Sleep Window
        [Arguments]                                     ${start_datetime}
        ...                                             ${scheduled_time}
        ${current_datetime}=                            Get Current Date
        ${timedelta}=                                   Subtract Date From Date  ${start_datetime}  ${current_datetime}
        ...                                             result_format=verbose
        ${remaining_start_time_adjusted}=               Add Time To Time  ${timedelta}  ${scheduled_time}
        Robot Log Operation                             Waiting For The Start Of Extreme Deep Sleep Window...
        wait.wait_until_specific_time_passed            start=${current_datetime}
        ...                                             time=${remaining_start_time_adjusted}

Wait For The End Of Extreme Deep Sleep Window
        [Arguments]                                     ${start_datetime}
        ...                                             ${scheduled_time}
        ${current_datetime}=                            Get Current Date
        ${remaining_stop_time}=                         Add Time To Date  ${start_datetime}  ${scheduled_time}
        ${timedelta}=                                   Subtract Date From Date  ${remaining_stop_time}  ${current_datetime}
